cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the software if you use FEATool Multiphysics in your work."
title: "FEATool Multiphysics"
type: software

authors:
  - name: "Precise Simulation"

abstract: >
  FEATool Multiphysics is a finite element analysis (FEA),
  computational fluid dynamics (CFD), partial differential equations
  (PDEs), and multiphysics simulation toolbox. It provides a fully
  integrated graphical user interface (GUI) and programmable MATLAB
  and Python workflows for geometry modeling, mesh generation, physics
  and boundary condition definition, solving, postprocessing, and
  visualization.  FEATool includes built-in finite element solvers and
  interfaces to external solvers including OpenFOAM, FEniCS, and SU2
  for multiphysics, CFD, and engineering simulations.

keywords:
  - multiphysics simulation
  - finite element analysis (FEA)
  - computational fluid dynamics (CFD)
  - partial differential equations (PDE)
  - MATLAB FEA toolbox
  - MATLAB CFD toolbox
  - Python multiphysics
  - OpenFOAM GUI
  - FEniCS GUI
  - SU2
  - engineering simulation
  - computer aided engineering (CAE)
  - continuum mechanics
  - scientific computing

repository-code: "https://github.com/precise-simulation/featool-multiphysics"
url: "https://www.featool.com/"
version: "1.18.1"
date-released: "2026-07-15"
